<title>UK: London palladium fixes at 3-1/2 year low.</title>
<headline>London palladium fixes at 3-1/2 year low.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palladium fixed at $115.25 an ounce on Friday morning, the lowest fixing since April 21, 1993.</p>
<p>On that date it had fixed at $115.00 an ounce. Palladium has been sliding on oversupply and low consumer demand and had fixed at a three-year low of $115.75 on Thursday afternoon.</p>
